    "title": "Oswego County Residents Invited to Vote on Community-Designed Projects - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Contributor ,\n15 hours ago Winning Project to be announced at May 28 Community Celebration. The Central New York Community Foundation is inviting Oswego County residents to help decide how $75,000 will be invested in their communities through the final voting phase of its participatory budgeting initiative, part of the Community Foundation’s centennial celebration. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
